        "content": [
          "For TS recruitment, the first step is",
          "advise unsuccessful candidates",
          "if the terms and conditions of the offer for a candidate need to be sorted out, it is necessary to check if the candidate has accepted a voluntary redundancy",
          "If the candidate has not accepted",
          "If the candidate has not accepted, the process continues.",
          "The recruitment manager sends an Appointment Approval form",
          "received by the next level manager",
          "if the approver is an existing employee",
          "if the approver is an existing employee of the client, the process continues.",
          "If the form is approved",
          "sends the form and other documentation",
          "received by the client HR",
          "The HR department scans the completed form and records the position against the stored position in GovSource.",
          "Otherwise, the process continues.",
          "The Appointment Approval is carried forward.",
          "Otherwise, a medical assessment is not necessary",
          "The TS HR coordinator informs the recruitment manager",
          "liaises with the HR representative to confirm the offer to the candidate",
          "if the assessment is fine",
          "if the assessment is fine, the process continues.",
          "makes a formal verbal offer of employment to the candidate",
          "If the candidate declines",
          "Simultaneously",
          "the commencement pack and letter of appointment are sent to the candidate",
          "Once the candidate receives these documents",
          "Otherwise, if the candidate accepts, the process continues."
        ]
